{
  "title": { "zh": "一对一" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "fact": "inject",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "同一个构造子造出的两个值相等，参数也相等：S a = S b，则 a = b。这叫<wiki-ref to=\"injectivity\"></wiki-ref>。声明没有直接给出这条规则，要借一个函数证出来：pred 取一个数的前一个。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "证出的一对一进了「数理规则书」。Lean 的内核里，同一件事叫 noConfusion。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "in-inject_1",
      "kind": "define",
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "step": { "zh": "前一个数" },
      "fn": "pred",
      "on": 0,
      "rows": [
        { "lhs": "pred(zero)", "choices": ["zero", "s(zero)"] },
        { "lhs": "pred(s(x))", "choices": ["x", "s(x)", "pred(x)"] }
      ],
      "tests": [
        { "term": "pred(s(s(zero)))", "value": "s(zero)" },
        { "term": "pred(s(zero))", "value": "zero" },
        { "term": "pred(zero)", "value": "zero" }
      ],
      "solution": ["zero", "x"],
      "naive": ["zero", "pred(x)"],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "给每一行写出右边。"
      },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "0 前面没有数，就取 0。" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "in-inject_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "S 一对一" },
      "consts": ["zero"],
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "cases": [],
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "∀x. pred(s(x)) = x" }, "goal": "∀x. ∀y. s(x) = s(y) → x = y" }],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "从 pred 的定义证出：若 S x = S y，则 x = y。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "pred 的定义分别取 a 和 b。" },
        { "zh": "假设的 S a = S b 可以改写其中一句。" }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "gx = allI[x=a](body: gy) {",
        "  body {",
        "    gy = allI[x=b](body: f) {",
        "      body {",
        "        f = impI[A=\"s(a) = s(b)\"](body: w2) {",
        "          body {",
        "            e1 = allE[t=a](p)",
        "            e2 = allE[t=b](p)",
        "            w1 = rewrite[at=[0]](f.body, e1)",
        "            w2 = rewrite[at=[0]](w1, e2)",
        "          }",
        "        }",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- gx"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
